{
  "info": {
    "name": "Samskrtam Lemma Classification (direct)",
    "description": "Прямой вызов sangraha-service (мимо gateway) для классификации лемм. Endpoints: docs/services/sangraha-service/lemma-classification.md. Порт sangraha-service из .env — SANGRAHA_SERVICE_PORT (по умолчанию 8089). Токен не нужен — сервис доверяет заголовку X-User-Id (на проде ADMin; gateway подменяет его на реального пользователя).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "sangrahaBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8089",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminUserId",
      "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "runId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "classificationId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Refresh lemma statistics",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-User-Id",
            "value": "{{adminUserId}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": ""
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}/sangraha/internal/lexicon/lemmas/refresh-statistics",
          "host": ["{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["sangraha", "internal", "lexicon", "lemmas", "refresh-statistics"]
        },
        "description": "Пересчёт словаря Lemma + статистики LemmaStatistics из корпуса VerseWord (§1.3). Ответ: {lemmaCount, newLemmaCount, updatedLemmaCount, statisticsCount, newStatisticsCount, updatedStatisticsCount}. Выполнить перед классификацией, если корпус менялся."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Start classification run",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-User-Id",
            "value": "{{adminUserId}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"schemeCode\": \"CURRICULUM\",\n  \"batchSize\": 50,\n  \"batchCount\": 10\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}/sangraha/internal/lexicon/classification/runs",
          "host": ["{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["sangraha", "internal", "lexicon", "classification", "runs"]
        },
        "description": "Запуск batch-классификации (§3). batchCount обязателен (лимит на прогон), batchSize по умолчанию 50. Ответ содержит runId — сохраняется в переменную коллекции."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('runId', json.runId);",
              "pm.test('run started', () => pm.expect(json.runId).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Run status",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-User-Id",
            "value": "{{adminUserId}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}/sangraha/internal/lexicon/classification/runs/{{runId}}",
          "host": ["{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["sangraha", "internal", "lexicon", "classification", "runs", "{{runId}}"]
        },
        "description": "Статус прогона (§3 шаг 6): {runId, schemeCode, requestedBatchCount, completedBatchCount, status, succeededBatchCount, failedBatchCount, classifiedLemmaCount}."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. List for review",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-User-Id",
            "value": "{{adminUserId}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}/sangraha/internal/lexicon/classifications?schemeCode=CURRICULUM&status=CANDIDATE&limit=100",
          "host": ["{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["sangraha", "internal", "lexicon", "classifications"],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "schemeCode",
              "value": "CURRICULUM"
            },
            {
              "key": "status",
              "value": "CANDIDATE"
            },
            {
              "key": "limit",
              "value": "100"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Список на review (§4): кандидаты, отсортированы по убыванию occurrenceCount статистики (частотные первыми). Пагинация курсором: следующий лист — добавить &cursor={{nextCursor}} из ответа. Первый id сохраняется в переменную classificationId."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json.items && json.items.length > 0) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('classificationId', json.items[0].id);",
              "}",
              "pm.test('returns items', () => pm.expect(json.items).to.be.an('array'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Review / approve",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-User-Id",
            "value": "{{adminUserId}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"APPROVED\",\n  \"categoryCode\": \"animals\",\n  \"glossRu\": \"слон\",\n  \"glossEn\": \"elephant\",\n  \"confidence\": 85\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}/sangraha/internal/lexicon/classifications/{{classificationId}}",
          "host": ["{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["sangraha", "internal", "lexicon", "classifications", "{{classificationId}}"]
        },
        "description": "Исправление полей + подтверждение (§4). status=REJECTED — просто отклонить (лемма не экспортируется и не переклассифицируется автоматически). APPROVED требует валидный categoryCode. categoryCode можно опустить (останется текущий)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Export APPROVED",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-User-Id",
            "value": "{{adminUserId}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}/sangraha/internal/lexicon/lemma-classifications/export?schemeCode=CURRICULUM&limit=500",
          "host": ["{{sangrahaBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["sangraha", "internal", "lexicon", "lemma-classifications", "export"],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "schemeCode",
              "value": "CURRICULUM"
            },
            {
              "key": "limit",
              "value": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Экспорт только APPROVED для curriculum-service (§5). Пагинация курсором по lemmaId (nextCursor из ответа)."
      }
    }
  ]
}
